      difficulty: {
        easy: 'Legal',
        medium: 'As Pitch',
        hard: null,
      },
      considerations: [
        'Be the first to reach 14 points. Points are scored for high (highest trump in play), low (lowest trump in play), jack (jack of trumps), off-jack, high joker, low joker, game (most card points in tricks), last trick, high spade (1 each), and five of trumps (5 points). Bid to become pitcher and name trump; make your bid or be set back.',
        'Six cards each, dealt in two rounds of three. One round of bidding (min 3, max smudge 15); dealer may steal with equal bid and must bid 3 if all pass. After bidding, each player discards three and is replenished to six from the stock. Pitcher leads to first trick (trump need not be led). Follow suit or trump; you may trump even when holding the led suit; may only play off-suit when unable to follow. Six tricks. Points awarded to the player winning each point card in a trick; game point to most card points in tricks. First to 14 wins.',
        '14 point game',
        '54 cards with two jokers',
      ],
    },
