          roles: [],
          customActions: [],
          deckDescription: 'A standard 52-card French deck plus two jokers (54 cards). Tunkhannock 14-point Pitch uses the full pack; the off-jack (same color as trump jack) and high and low jokers rank as trumps just below the jack. The high bidder becomes pitcher and names trump by leading; points are scored for high, low, jack, off-jack, jokers, game, last trick, high spade, and five of trumps.',
          suitDescription: 'The four French suits (hearts, diamonds, clubs, spades) each have thirteen cards plus two jokers. The pitcher names trump; that suit plus off-jack and jokers beats plain suits in tricks. Off-suit plays only win if no trump is played.',
          rankDescription: 'Standard ranks with Ace high. In trumps: Ace, King, Queen, Jack, off-jack, high joker, low joker, then 10 down to 2. Point cards (high, low, jack, off-jack, jokers, game, last trick, high spade, five) are scored to 14 to win.',
          dealPattern: '3,3',
          bettingLimits: 'NA',
          actions: {},
          handRankingSystem: 'Pitch point scoring: high, low, jack, off-jack, jokers, game, last trick, high spade, five (14 points total).',
          rankingSystem: '',
          useTrump: true,
